{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52436","headline":"回波乐 七十九 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 七十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不思身去促，能贪无限财。\n生平惜（一作「借」）不用，命尽如粪堆。\n虫蛆内攘攘，食脉烂穴开。\n罗锦缠屍送，枉屈宝将埋。\n宁知入土後，二节变爲灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}